                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Recess-palooza stop #13 -- according to the 41 year-tenured Director, I was the first Congressman to ever take a tour of @palmcoastgov Wastewater Treatment Plant #1, which will be undergoing a several hundred million dollar expansion.   \n\nI've worked on Florida water issues since I was first elected to the Florida House, and am excited to keep doing it in Congress. \n\nThanks to Vice Mayor Theresa Pontieri and Councilmen Ty Miller and David Sullivan for showing me around and to @FlaglerLive @NewsFlagler @PalmCoastNowFL @BuzzFlagle438 @AskFlagler and @dbnewsjournal for joining us.",
